{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"74920fed80a588f393a3039fbd6ebc2d45c4cb1d76602360e9ad46acbf990867","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_6d53c4c0c08d8264b62183d9ede2b511de6f944a51ea86542a87e3a8a912b097","overall_assessment":"The paper is generally well-organized and clearly written, with a logical flow from problem definition to method and experiments. The mathematical notation is consistent and well-defined, and the tables are readable. However, the clarity of the algorithm presentation is hindered by the absence of pseudocode and a minor inconsistency in the reported results between the abstract and the conclusion.","paper_id":"B1-q5Pqxl","paper_identity_sha256":"5bc4c734c931c49f5a299cc06977752b6ef3445954a00f620352b4548fd827c5","prompt_identity_sha256":"109f7811aba30b6b8299ea7ae7c4e3e66fbbd2869d4e11e156c19f015715802a","raw_response_sha256":"eda0f79b3b11b77b5ce8b17ac0968caef7b21779a42623933afc4987bfee4eef","request_identity_sha256":"00c1a104dd5b434eb8ec599eb621807cf0bd489eb004ed90f20dadd4956275a1","reviewer_identity_sha256":"32b29c26fbf1508e066dfb25b1a9a3fe0654c5869a7da3020e1e8e61940befe3","role":"CLAR","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"246e42ed15511d2829c5c387e87312a72aba34e11eccfcf439d0ef8721f75d25","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001","SRC-006","SRC-007","SRC-012","SRC-034"],"review_text":"The paper is well-structured, with a clear introduction, method, experiments, and conclusion. The terminology is precise, and the concepts of match-LSTM and Pointer Net are well-explained. However, the algorithm presentation could be improved by including pseudocode for the two models (sequence and boundary), as the current description relies heavily on mathematical equations and prose, which may be less accessible to some readers. Additionally, there is a minor inconsistency in the reported results: the abstract states an exact match score of 67.9% and an F1 score of 77.0%, while the conclusion reports 67.6% and 77%, respectively. This discrepancy should be resolved to avoid confusion.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-WRT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-010","SRC-014","SRC-015","SRC-016","SRC-017","SRC-019","SRC-020","SRC-021","SRC-022"],"review_text":"The mathematical notation is consistent and well-defined. The dimensions of the matrices and vectors are clearly specified, and the equations are well-explained. The use of attention mechanisms and the derivation of the match-LSTM and Answer Pointer layers are clearly presented. The notation for the sequence and boundary models is distinct and easy to follow. No significant issues were found in the mathematical explanation.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-NOT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-005","SRC-009","SRC-022","SRC-026","SRC-039"],"review_text":"The tables in the paper are readable and well-organized. Table 1 provides a clear example of the SQuAD dataset, and Table 2 presents the experimental results in a structured format. The captions for the figures are detailed and provide sufficient context. However, the visual clarity of the figures cannot be assessed due to the text-only nature of the input. The textual descriptions of the figures are informative and align with the content of the paper.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-FIG"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"a07dea6c59ff77642c64b9e9b853a390935615428146d51b871abd246bc156dc","paper_id":"B1-q5Pqxl","paper_ordinal":1,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"eda0f79b3b11b77b5ce8b17ac0968caef7b21779a42623933afc4987bfee4eef","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"B1-q5Pqxl","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"43aee3435d58ddad87b2648fcf4136f48ea6d934b4beed8eea8b65137ac5c2fc","request_identity_sha256":"00c1a104dd5b434eb8ec599eb621807cf0bd489eb004ed90f20dadd4956275a1","role":"CLAR","schema_version":"no-memory-full-review-corpus-build-v6","usage":{"completion_tokens"